    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it feels like a lot of people argue that diversity is always a good thing, but they don't really talk about the downsides of losing that shared identity. how would you respond to the argument that 'cultural preservation' is just a way to exclude people or that it's outdated in a globalized world?",
